# Generated from wrangler.jsonc by `wrangler types`, which `npm run build` and `npm run check`
# both run first. Ignored rather than committed on purpose: 549 KB of generated types that go
# stale against the config without saying so — the committed copy had been missing `vars.SIGNUP`
# for a week. Do not "fix" a CI type error by committing this file.
